[{"title":"莺啼序","author":"周之琦","text":"鸳帏麝熏顿冷，忍重窥牗户。\n梦缘短、花落鹃啼，坐惜长簟催暮。\n弄红豆、何人记曲。\n回肠宛转相思树。\n甚兰房翻似，离亭淡烟飞絮。\n屈指频年，故里道梗，尚南天掩雾。\n话前事、娥月含嚬，眼穿江上鱼素。\n耿无眠、深更漏咽，帕罗湿、愁丝千缕。\n枉叮咛，莲舫同游，锦泾鹓鹭。\n萍踪暗想，片叶天涯，几回趁雁旅。\n鹤去远、笛楼吹罢，夏口遄归，又逐扁舟，陡河听雨。\n鸾骖信杳，蜂衙香散，翩然春水凌波袜，唤归禽、柳色甘棠渡。\n从看倚竹，牵萝半萼青灯，澹泊肯厌乡土。\n安居自适，履迹闲园，待艺庥沤苎。\n奈几载、悲笳传恨，病骨攲床，浣泪单衫，退红羞舞。\n中秋近也，灵丹无验，优昙开好还易萎，动哀吟、华表谁家柱。\n他时青鸟飞回，鬓雪韦郎，倩魂记否。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8082,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"愁倚栏令","author":"周之琦","text":"怜花好，惜花残。\n倚栏干。\n长向仇英图画里，认家山。\n年来瘦损朱颜。\n芳心冷，鸾镜羞看。\n禁得杏梁双燕子，说春寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8083,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"愁倚栏令","author":"周之琦","text":"鸳针歇，画屏闲。\n病经年。\n可惜天孙云锦样，倩谁传。\n罗囊旧绣依然。\n无聊赖，尘壁空悬。\n争忍看他珠络索，翠连娟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8084,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河满子","author":"周之琦","text":"栽得幽花数种，小庭雨腻烟浓。\n春自天台移到，人如阆苑相逢。\n今日人将春去，露珠啼碎香红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8085,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河满子","author":"周之琦","text":"忆昔蒲觞饮后，惊心风鹤来时。\n多少朱门绣毂，匆匆絮影分飞。\n争似吾家络秀，琐窗闲赌围棋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8086,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河满子","author":"周之琦","text":"雅戏闺中裁制，春工幻作春人。\n粉壁空留剪彩，玉墀已掩香尘。\n莫向紫姑说与，红笺应也销魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8087,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉垂鞭","author":"周之琦","text":"莫唱望江南。\n娃宫柳。\n沉吟久。\n烟外影鬖鬖。\n清霜知未堪。\n魂归应恋此。\n虚廊倚。\n旧香拈。\n悄拭藕丝衫。\n防他珠泪淹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8088,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惜双双","author":"周之琦","text":"梁燕依依成伴侣。\n谁遣把、离愁深诉。\n江海漫惜归去。\n隔后春社还相遇。\n独有巫峰天外路。\n无计使、行云留住。\n三点四点更鼓。\n画帘听尽潇潇雨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8089,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水龙吟 丁己冬仲，俞婿自南康返浙，道出汴城，信宿别去，悒怏累日，赋此以遣闷怀","author":"周之琦","text":"病馀心事阑珊，英英润玉欣来至。\n奚奴传报，马嘶门外，鹊喧檐际。\n茸帽冲寒，尘襟浣雪，顿宽离思。\n奈停觞语促，倚闾望久，欲留也、浑无计。\n枉说灯花太喜。\n被春风、等闲吹碎。\n春如有约，人应依旧，关河千里。\n短烛心灰，归鞍目送，断魂潮尾。\n但摧颓一老，殷勤执手，洒临歧泪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8090,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石州慢 落花","author":"周之琦","text":"欲雨还晴，春色正妍，游兴方引。\n彩幡蓦地飘摇，多事晓风吹紧。\n东君薄幸，空负燕约莺期，无端轻送韶华尽。\n仙子玉峰来，又催回兰轸。\n愁损。\n蜀笺题字，吴舫传杯，少年青鬓。\n已是凄凉，那更翠凋红陨。\n冬郎好句，留下千古伤心，人间易得芳时恨。\n忍见葬花人，扫苔阶香粉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8091,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"摸鱼儿 丁煦洲先生索题某司马湖庄福隐图","author":"周之琦","text":"占幽居、六桥东畔，天然柳港花坞。\n书楼掩映窗三面，咫尺翠屏云聚。\n携胜侣。\n算福地、仙乡最好诗人住。\n吟情漫与。\n怕竹马迎来，金鱼挽定，未放使君去。\n空中想，指点刘郎前度。\n盟鸥今在何许。\n卅年影事匆匆过，谁访绿苔题句。\n清梦阻。\n更那得、片帆吹到江南路。\n披图认取。\n但栏角听莺，船唇载鹤，寻我旧游处。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8092,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阮郎归","author":"周之琦","text":"绿云鬟倚小桃枝。\n盈盈把袂时。\n玉箫吹作凤双飞。\n春光无尽期。\n仙梦短，俗情迷。\n翩然一鹤归。\n人民城郭是耶非。\n伤心丁令威。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8093,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阮郎归","author":"周之琦","text":"东风吹冷碧桃花。\n尘心枉自嗟。\n合欢衾外即天涯。\n谁教归兴赊。\n寻故步，趁丹霞。\n仙山路未差。\n愿持鸦觜种胡麻。\n从今休忆家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8094,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"周之琦","text":"暮笳吹送江南怨，远信模糊。\n噩梦踟蹰。\n烽火连天照海虞。\n旧家门馆知何似，断柳啼乌。\n破瓦奔狐。\n留得东阳子姓无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8095,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"周之琦","text":"檀郎歌管凄凉曲，叹息清门。\n月冷烟昏。\n一霎昆明劫后尘。\n世间何限伤心事，漫说真真。\n早岁离魂。\n免得思家积泪痕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8096,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子","author":"周之琦","text":"左芬书问经年断，南雁飘零。\n又说吴兴。\n日夜风传唳鹤声。\n昔年避乱栖湖溇，烟水凄清。\n今日伶仃。\n可许荒湾寄此生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8097,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"更漏子 庚申岁杪，密雪经旬，中庭积厚四五尺，平生所未见也","author":"周之琦","text":"篆烟沈，灯炷落。\n愁掩夜寒帘幕。\n天黯澹，路冥迷，征人何日归。\n唤春回，春未醒。\n谁念玉梅香冷。\n残岁逼，暮云深，休听元鹤吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8098,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金缕曲 卖宅","author":"周之琦","text":"燕子闻长叹。\n甚匆匆、廿年安宅，梦缘能短。\n曾是琴尊游息地，苦被啼莺催散。\n且休说、仙源深浅。\n洞口云来迷处所，悔当时、只作寻常看。\n枉回首、画栏畔。\n嫣红姹紫闲栽遍，到而今亭台易主，旧欢空恋。\n从此春风无路入，那见小桃人面。\n更谁与、金荃歌按。\n可惜好花如好婢，向人家、看卖牙郎绢。\n重为汝、泪痕溅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8099,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水调歌头 辛酉三月廿七日，移居文殊寺巷，所谓蜗角蚊睫，又足相容者也","author":"周之琦","text":"往事过驹隙，末路寄蜗庐。\n不知箪食瓢饮，陋巷较何如。\n小植红桃绿柳，闲缚茅篱竹栅，幽梦蝶蘧蘧。\n朱绂者谁子，门外已过车。\n邺侯井，徐稚榻，子云居。\n翩然舍去聊可，著论拟潜夫。\n昔日天花弹指，今日缁尘满眼。\n香界久榛芜，我有数椽庇，犹足傲文殊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8100,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天","author":"周之琦","text":"仙侣何因证旧欢。\n素屏凉影有无间。\n三生石泐情长在，半萼灯孤夜未阑。\n蛩语寂，鹤声闲。\n片云从此谢尘寰。\n凭谁访我栖真地，黄叶萧萧玉笥山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8101,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绝句二首 其一","author":"陈锡金","text":"百尺楼头豪气，一条冰上高风。\n此系吾家本色，外人不得混同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8102,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题吴南芗东方三大图","author":"龚自珍","text":"禽父始宅奄，犹未荒大东。\n周王有名祀，名山止龟蒙。\n尚父赐履海，泱泱表大风。\n时无神仙言，不睹金银宫。\n春秋贬宋父，坐失玉与弓。\n祊田富汤沐，季旅何懜懜。\n秦穆作西畤，帝醉终可逢。\n恒无三脊茅，遂辍登山踪。\n顽哉鲁与齐，灵气不牖衷。\n孤负介海岱，海深岱徒崇。\n素王张三世，元始而麟终。\n文成号数万，太平告成功。\n其文富沧海，其旨高苍穹。\n于是海岱英，尽入孔牢笼。\n熙朝翠华至，九跪迎上公。\n厥典盛谒林，汉后无兹隆。\n惜哉有阙遗，未举金泥封。\n小臣若上议，廷臣三日聋。\n首谒孔林毕，继请行升中。\n继请射沧海，三事碑三通。\n古体日霾晦，但嗤秦汉雄。\n周情与孔思，执笔思忡忡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8103,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路易","author":"龚自珍","text":"东山猛虎不吃人，西山猛虎吃人，南山猛虎吃人，北山猛虎不食人。\n漫漫趋避何所已，玉帝不遣牖下死，一双瞳神射秋水。\n袖中芳草岂不香，手中玉麈岂不长。\n中妇岂不姝，座客岂不都。\n江大水深多江鱼，江边何哓呶。\n人不足，盱有馀，夏父以来目矍矍。\n我欲食江鱼，江水涩咙喉，鱼骨亦不可以餐。\n冤屈复冤屈，果然龙蛇蟠我喉舌间，使我说天九难、说地九难。\n踉跄入中门，中门一步一荆棘，大药不疗膏肓顽。\n鼻涕一尺何其孱，臣请逝矣逝勿还。\n嘈嘈舟师，三五詈汝：汝以白昼放歌为可惜，而乃脂汝辖。\n汝以黄金散尽为复来，而乃鞭其脢。\n红玫瑰，青镜台，美人别汝光徘徊。\n腷腷膊膊，鸡鸣狗鸣。\n淅淅索索，风声雨声。\n浩浩荡荡，仙都玉京。\n蟠桃之花万丈明，淮南之犬彳亍行。\n臣岂不如武皇阶下东方生。\n乱曰：三寸舌，一枝笔，万言书，万人敌，九天九渊少颜色。\n朝衣东市甘如饴，玉体须为美人惜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8104,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦得“东海潮来月怒明”之句，醒，足成一诗 其一","author":"龚自珍","text":"昙誓天人度有情，上元旌节过双成。\n西池酒罢龙娇语，东海潮来月怒明。\n梵史竣编增楮寿，花神宣敕赦词精。\n不知半夜归环佩，问是崆峒第几声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8105,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦得“东海潮来月怒明”之句，醒，足成一诗 又成一诗 其二","author":"龚自珍","text":"东海潮来月上弦，崆峒抚罢静诸天。\n西池一宴无消息，替管桃花五百年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8106,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"邻儿半夜哭","author":"龚自珍","text":"邻儿半夜哭，或言忆前生。\n前生何所忆，或者变文名。\n我有一箧书，属草殊未成。\n涂乙迨一纪，甘苦万千并。\n百忧消中夜，何如坐经营。\n剪烛蹶然起，婢笑妻复嗔。\n万一明朝死，堕地泪纵横。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8107,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其一","author":"龚自珍","text":"少小无端爱令名，也无学术误苍生。\n白云一笑懒如此，忽遇天风吹便行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8108,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其二","author":"龚自珍","text":"文格渐卑庸福近，不知庸福究何如。\n常州庄四能怜我，劝我狂删乙丙书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8109,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其三","author":"龚自珍","text":"情多处处有悲欢，何必沧桑始浩叹。\n昨过城西晒书地，蠹鱼无数讯平安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8110,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其四","author":"龚自珍","text":"手种江山千树花，今年负杀武陵霞。\n梦中自怯才情减，醒又缠绵感岁华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8111,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其五","author":"龚自珍","text":"庞眉名与段公齐，一脉东原高第题。\n回首外家书帙散，大儒门祚古难跻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8112,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其六","author":"龚自珍","text":"昨日相逢刘礼部，高言大句快无加。\n从君烧尽虫鱼学，甘作东京卖饼家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8113,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其七","author":"龚自珍","text":"十年提倡受恩身，惨绿年华记忆真。\n江左名场前辈在，敢将名氏厕陈人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8114,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其八","author":"龚自珍","text":"偶赋山川行路难，浮名十载避诗坛。\n贵人相讯劳相护，莫作人间清议看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8115,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其九","author":"龚自珍","text":"万柳堂前一柳无，词流散尽散樵苏。\n山东不少升平相，为溯前茅冯益都。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8116,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其十","author":"龚自珍","text":"荷叶粘天玉蝀桥，万重金碧影如潮。\n功成倘赐移家住，何必湖山理故箫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8117,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其十一","author":"龚自珍","text":"交臂神峰未一登，梦吞丹篆亦何曾。\n丈夫三十愧前辈，识字游山两不能。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8118,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其十二","author":"龚自珍","text":"楼阁参差未上灯，菰芦深处有人行。\n凭君且莫登高望，忽忽中原暮霭生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8119,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其十三","author":"龚自珍","text":"东抹西涂迫半生，中年何故避声名。\n才流百辈无餐饭，忽动慈悲不与争。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8120,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗，己卯自春徂夏，在京师作，得十四首 其十四","author":"龚自珍","text":"欲为平易近人诗，下笔清深不自持。\n洗尽狂名消尽想，本无一字是吾师。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8121,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题红蕙花诗册尾 其一","author":"龚自珍","text":"香满吟笺酒满卮，枫桥宾客夜灯时。\n故家池馆今何许，红蕙花开空染枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8122,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题红蕙花诗册尾 其二","author":"龚自珍","text":"读罢一时才子句，《骚》香汉艳各精神。\n十年我恨生差晚，不见风流种蕙人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8123,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题红蕙花诗册尾 其三","author":"龚自珍","text":"歌板无聊舞袖凉，江南词话断人肠。\n人生合种闲花草，莫遣黄金怨国香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8124,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题红蕙花诗册尾 其四","author":"龚自珍","text":"眼前谁是此花身，寂寞猩红万古春。\n花有家乡侬替管，五湖添个泛舟人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8125,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张诗舲前辈游西山归索赠三首 其一","author":"龚自珍","text":"鸾吟凤叫下人寰，绝顶题名振笔还。\n樵客忽传仙墨满，禁中才子昨游山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8126,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张诗舲前辈游西山归索赠三首 其二","author":"龚自珍","text":"去年扈从东巡守，玉佩琼琚大放辞。\n等是才华不巉削，愿携康乐诵君诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8127,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张诗舲前辈游西山归索赠三首 其三","author":"龚自珍","text":"畿辅千山互长雄，太行一臂怒趋东。\n祝君腰脚长如意，吟遍蜿蜒北干龙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8128,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"驿鼓三首 其一","author":"龚自珍","text":"河灯驿鼓满天霜，小梦温黁乱客肠。\n夜久罗帱梅弄影，春寒银铫药生香。\n慈闱病减书频寄，稚子功闲日渐长。\n欲取离愁暂抛却，奈君针线在衣裳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8129,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"驿鼓三首 其二","author":"龚自珍","text":"钗满高楼灯满城，风花未免态纵横。\n长途借此销英气，侧调安能犯正声。\n绿鬓人嗤愁太早，黄金客怒散无名。\n吾生万事劳心意，嫁得狂奴孽已成。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8130,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"驿鼓三首 其三","author":"龚自珍","text":"书来恳款见君贤，我欲收狂渐向禅。\n早被家常磨慧骨，莫因心病损华年。\n花看天上祈庸福，月堕怀中听幻缘。\n一卷金经香一炷，忏君自忏法无边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8131,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"发洞庭，舟中怀钮非石树玉、叶青原昶","author":"龚自珍","text":"西山春昼别，两袖落梅风。\n不见小龙渚，尚闻隔渚钟。\n樽前荇叶白，舵尾茶华红。\n仙境杳然杳，酸吟雨一篷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8132,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"此游 其一","author":"龚自珍","text":"此游好补前游罅，挥手云声浩不闻。\n两度山灵濡笔记，钱塘君访洞庭君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8133,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"此游 其二","author":"龚自珍","text":"舟到西山岸，寻幽迤逦斜。\n居然六七里，无境不烟霞。\n遂发石公寺，定过神女家。\n云和风静里，已度万梅花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8134,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"此游 其三","author":"龚自珍","text":"风意中流引，香烟在屿迟。\n悠扬闻杜若，仿佛邀蛾眉。\n白日憺明镜，春空飘彩旗。\n湖东一回首，万古长相思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8135,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过扬州","author":"龚自珍","text":"春灯如雪浸兰舟，不载江南半点愁。\n谁信寻春此狂客，一茶一偈过扬州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8136,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"观心","author":"龚自珍","text":"结习真难尽，观心屏见闻。\n烧香僧出定，哗梦鬼论文。\n幽绪不可食，新诗如乱云。\n鲁阳戈纵挽，万虑亦纷纷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8137,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"又忏心一首","author":"龚自珍","text":"佛言劫火遇皆销，何物千年怒若潮。\n经济文章磨白昼，幽光狂慧复中宵。\n来何汹涌须挥剑，去尚缠绵可付箫。\n心药心灵总心病，寓言决欲就灯烧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8138,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"庚辰春日重过门楼胡衕故宅","author":"龚自珍","text":"城西郎官屯，多官阅一宅。\n家公昔为郎，有此湫隘室。\n朝阳与夕阳，屋角红不积。\n春雨复秋雨，双扉故钉齿。\n无形不知老，有质乃易蚀。\n往事思之悔，至理悟独立。\n中有故我魂，三呼如欲出。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8139,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"因忆两首 其一","author":"龚自珍","text":"因忆横街宅，槐花五丈青。\n文章酸辣早，《知觉》鬼神灵。\n大挠支干始，中年记忆荧。\n东墙凉月下，何客又横经。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8140,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"因忆两首 其二","author":"龚自珍","text":"因忆斜街宅，情苗茁一丝。\n银缸吟小别，书本画相思。\n亦具看花眼，难忘授《选》时。\n泥牛入沧海，执笔向空追。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8141,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客春，住京师之丞相胡衕，有丞相胡衕春梦诗二十绝句。春又深矣，因烧此作，而奠以一绝句","author":"龚自珍","text":"春梦撩天笔一枝，梦中伤骨醒难支。\n今年烧梦先烧笔，检点青天白昼诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8142,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春晚送客","author":"龚自珍","text":"潞水滔滔南向流，家书重叠附征邮。\n行人临发长亭晚，更折梨花寄暮愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":8143,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]